2026-09-24T02:59:41.9918683Z   dw view technical                  Open the complete engineering command surface
2026-09-24T02:59:41.9918978Z 
2026-09-24T02:59:41.9919204Z A blocked or observed runtime action is not proof that the final software works.
2026-09-24T02:59:41.9919865Z DiffWitness verifies the resulting Git change independently. Source code and raw prompts/diffs stay local by default.
2026-09-24T02:59:41.9920313Z 
2026-09-24T02:59:41.9920534Z For every command and advanced workflow: `dw view technical`, then `dw --help`.
2026-09-24T02:59:41.9920844Z 
2026-09-24T02:59:41.9921304Z Language: English by default. Save with `dw language en|fr`; override once with `dw --language en|fr <command>`. OS locale never selects product language.
